BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 508.80 Tm (1. Scope of this bulletin) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 482.40 Tm (This bulletin consolidates three unrelated items arising from the January) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 469.20 Tm (meeting of the Pharmacy and Therapeutics Committee. Items are presented in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 456.00 Tm (order discussed and are not ranked by clinical significance. Sites should read) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 442.80 Tm (section 3 in full.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 416.40 Tm (2. Formulary status) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 390.00 Tm (Renuvex remains a restricted-formulary agent at all sites. The restriction is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 376.80 Tm (administrative and relates to acquisition cost; it carries no safety) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 363.60 Tm (implication. Requests for non-formulary use continue to be handled by the site) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 350.40 Tm (pharmacy lead.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 324.00 Tm (3. Renal considerations in continuing therapy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 297.60 Tm (Renuvex is eliminated by the kidney and its elimination half-life lengthens as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 284.40 Tm (glomerular filtration falls. The Committee reviewed twenty-two months of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 271.20 Tm (dispensing and laboratory data from the three participating sites and found) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 258.00 Tm (considerable variation in how often renal function was being reassessed after) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 244.80 Tm (therapy was established - in a small number of instances, not at all. Having) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 231.60 Tm (considered that variation, and noting that a change in renal function is not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 218.40 Tm (reliably apparent from symptoms, the Committee agreed that patients on Renuvex) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 205.20 Tm (who have chronic kidney disease should have serum creatinine measured) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 192.00 Tm (quarterly while treatment continues, and that sites should put arrangements in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 178.80 Tm (place to make that happen rather than relying on opportunistic testing. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 165.60 Tm (requirement is effective from the date of this bulletin. Where a site cannot) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 152.40 Tm (meet it from existing capacity, the site pharmacy lead should escalate to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 139.20 Tm (Committee rather than allow the interval to extend.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 112.80 Tm (Separately, and not as a monitoring requirement, the Committee noted that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 99.60 Tm (baseline renal function is often recorded at first prescription. That practice) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 86.40 Tm (is encouraged but is not the subject of any interval requirement.) Tj ET
